{
  "meta.title": "方差比较",
  "intro.title": "方差比较",
  "sec.theorem.title": "方差比较定理",
  "sec.theorem.text1": "假设 $\\mathbf{X} \\sim \\mathbb{P}_\\theta$，其中 $\\theta \\in \\Theta \\subset \\mathbb{R}$，且 $\\mathbf{X}$ 的概率密度函数为 $f_\\theta(x)$，其中 $x \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$。设 $T(\\mathbf{X})$ 是 $g(\\theta)$ 的任意无偏估计量，并记作",
  "sec.theorem.eq1": "$$A(\\phi, \\theta) \\equiv \\mathbb{V}_\\theta \\left[ \\frac{f_\\phi(\\mathbf{X})}{f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X})} \\right].$$",
  "sec.theorem.eq2": "$$\\mathbb{V}_\\theta(T) \\ge \\sup_{\\phi \\in \\Theta} \\frac{\\{ g(\\phi) - g(\\theta) \\}^2}{A(\\phi, \\theta)}.$$",
  "sec.theorem.text2": "此不等式为 $g(\\theta)$ 的任何无偏估计量的方差提供了一个一般的下界。",
  "sec.proof.title": "证明",
  "sec.proof.text1": "首先，我们注意到对于任何无偏估计量 $T(\\mathbf{X})$，以下等式成立：",
  "sec.proof.eq1": "$$\\mathbb{E}_\\phi[T(\\mathbf{X})] = g(\\phi).$$",
  "sec.proof.eq2": "$$\\mathbb{E}_\\theta \\left[ \\{T(\\mathbf{X}) - g(\\theta)\\} \\left\\{ \\frac{f_\\phi(\\mathbf{X})}{f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X})} - 1 \\right\\} \\right] = g(\\phi) - g(\\theta).$$",
  "sec.proof.eq3": "$$\\int (T(x) - g(\\theta)) \\left( \\frac{f_\\phi(x)}{f_\\theta(x)} - 1 \\right) f_\\theta(x) dx = g(\\phi) - g(\\theta).$$",
  "sec.proof.eq4": "$$\\left\\{ g(\\phi) - g(\\theta) \\right\\}^2 \\le \\mathbb{V}_\\theta(T) \\cdot \\mathbb{V}_\\theta \\left( \\frac{f_\\phi(\\mathbf{X})}{f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X})} \\right).$$",
  "sec.proof.eq5": "$$\\Rightarrow \\; \\mathbb{V}_\\theta(T) \\ge \\frac{\\{ g(\\phi) - g(\\theta) \\}^2}{A(\\phi, \\theta)}.$$",
  "sec.proof.text2": "这就完成了不等式的证明。",
  "sec.change.title": "变化率形式",
  "sec.change.eq1": "$$\\mathbb{V}_\\theta(T) \\ge \\frac{\\{ g(\\phi) - g(\\theta) \\}^2}{A(\\phi, \\theta)} = \\frac{\\left\\{ \\frac{g(\\phi) - g(\\theta)}{\\phi - \\theta} \\right\\}^2}{\\mathbb{V}_\\theta \\left[ \\frac{f_\\phi(\\mathbf{X}) / f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X})}{\\phi - \\theta} \\right]}.$$",
  "sec.change.eq2": "$$\\approx \\frac{[g'(\\theta)]^2}{J(\\theta)}.$$",
  "sec.change.text": "这种表示将方差下界与 $g(\\theta)$ 相对于费雪信息的局部变化率联系起来。",
  "sec.limit.title": "极限表达式和费雪信息",
  "sec.limit.eq1": "$$A(\\phi, \\theta) = \\mathbb{V}_\\theta \\left[ \\frac{f_\\phi(\\mathbf{X})}{f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X})} \\right] = \\mathbb{V}_\\theta \\left[ \\frac{f_\\phi(\\mathbf{X})}{f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X})} - 1 \\right].$$",
  "sec.limit.eq2": "$$J(\\theta) = \\lim_{\\phi \\to \\theta} \\frac{A(\\phi, \\theta)}{(\\phi - \\theta)^2} = \\lim_{\\phi \\to \\theta} \\int \\frac{\\{f_\\phi(x) - f_\\theta(x)\\}^2}{(\\phi - \\theta)^2 f_\\theta(x)} dx.$$",
  "sec.limit.eq3": "$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\theta} \\log f_\\theta(x) = \\frac{1}{f_\\theta(x)} \\frac{\\partial f_\\theta(x)}{\\partial \\theta} = \\lim_{\\phi \\to \\theta} \\frac{f_\\phi(x) - f_\\theta(x)}{(\\phi - \\theta) f_\\theta(x)}.$$",
  "sec.limit.eq4": "$$J(\\theta) = \\int \\left( \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\theta} \\log f_\\theta(x) \\right)^2 f_\\theta(x) dx.$$",
  "sec.limit.eq5": "$$= \\mathbb{E}_\\theta \\left[ \\left( \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\theta} \\log f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X}) \\right)^2 \\right].$$",
  "sec.crlb.title": "克拉默-拉奥下界",
  "sec.crlb.eq1": "$$\\mathbb{V}_\\theta(T) \\ge \\frac{[g'(\\theta)]^2}{J(\\theta)}.$$",
  "sec.crlb.eq2": "$$J(\\theta) = \\int \\left( \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\theta} \\log f_\\theta(x) \\right)^2 f_\\theta(x) dx.$$",
  "sec.crlb.eq3": "$$= \\mathbb{E}_\\theta \\left[ \\left( \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\theta} \\log f_\\theta(\\mathbf{X}) \\right)^2 \\right].$$"
}